  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Government of Uganda to integrate climate actions into their recovery planning in response to the COVID-19 global pandemic.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The NDC Partnership is supporting governments to integrate climate actions into their recovery planning in response to the COVID-19 global pandemic. This support comes at a critical time when many countries are revising their climate commitments in 2020, through the enhancement of their Nationally Determined Contributions (NDCs).</narrative>
  </description>
